## 2. Onboarding Wizard

### When it triggers

After first sign-up, Clerk redirects to `/dashboard`. The dashboard layout checks if the founder has completed onboarding (`onboarding_completed_at` on `founders`). If null, redirect to `/onboarding`.

### 5-step wizard

| Step                | Route                 | Fields                                                                                                                        | Saves To                                       |
| ------------------- | --------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |
| 1. Welcome          | `/onboarding`         | None — animated intro with Starry's avatar, value prop, "Let's go" Shimmer Button                                             | Nothing                                        |
| 2. About You        | `/onboarding/about`   | Display name, role/title, LinkedIn URL, bio (optional)                                                                        | `founders` table                               |
| 3. Your Startup     | `/onboarding/startup` | Company name, one-liner, stage (dropdown: idea/pre-seed/seed/series-a/series-b+), category/industry                           | `startup_profiles` table                       |
| 4. Connect Accounts | `/onboarding/connect` | LinkedIn + GitHub via Clerk social connection linking (both optional, skippable). Google already connected via Clerk sign-up. | `founders.linkedin_url`, `founders.github_url` |
| 5. Ready            | `/onboarding/ready`   | Summary card showing entered data, mentor mode selector (Coach/Supportive/Investor Lens), "Meet Starry" CTA                   | Sets `onboarding_completed_at`, `mentor_mode`  |

### Visual treatment (Aceternity premium, dark theme)

- **Background:** Aurora Background or Background Beams behind entire wizard
- **Step transitions:** Motion `AnimatePresence` — slide + fade between steps
- **Step indicator:** Animated progress bar with Moving Border on active step
- **Primary CTAs:** Shimmer Button (Magic UI)
- **Form card:** Spotlight effect (Aceternity) — radial gradient follows cursor
- **Step 5 "Ready":** Number Ticker (Magic UI) animates profile completeness from 0% to calculated value
- **Starry's avatar:** Visible in Step 1 welcome and Step 5 ready — animated geometric mark in primary purple/violet

### Form handling

- `react-hook-form` + Zod validation per step
- Wizard state via URL params (step 1 -> step 2 via `router.push`)
- Each step auto-saves on "Next" (PATCH to backend)
- Back button preserves entered data

### Backend endpoints

- `PATCH /api/founders/me` — update founder profile fields
- `PATCH /api/founders/me/startup` — update startup profile fields
- `POST /api/founders/me/complete-onboarding` — sets `onboarding_completed_at` timestamp

### Frontend additions

- `apps/web/src/app/(onboarding)/layout.tsx` — onboarding route group layout (Aurora background, no sidebar)
- `apps/web/src/app/(onboarding)/page.tsx` — Step 1: Welcome
- `apps/web/src/app/(onboarding)/about/page.tsx` — Step 2: About You
- `apps/web/src/app/(onboarding)/startup/page.tsx` — Step 3: Your Startup
- `apps/web/src/app/(onboarding)/connect/page.tsx` — Step 4: Connect Accounts
- `apps/web/src/app/(onboarding)/ready/page.tsx` — Step 5: Ready

### Shared components (`packages/ui/`)

- `StepIndicator` — animated progress indicator with Moving Border
- `WizardCard` — form card with Spotlight hover effect
- `MentorAvatar` — Starry's animated avatar (geometric mark, breathing pulse)

