## 3. Dashboard Shell

### Layout

```
+----------+--------------------------------------------+
|          |                                            |
|  S  I    |                                            |
|  I  C    |         MAIN CONTENT AREA                  |
|  D  O    |                                            |
|  E  N    |         (page.tsx renders here)             |
|  B  S    |                                            |
|  A       |                                            |
|  R       |                                            |
|          |                                            |
+----+-----+                                            |
| User     |                                            |
+----------+--------------------------------------------+
```

### Sidebar contents (expanded, ~240px)

- **Top:** ZStar logo/brand mark
- **Nav links** (Phosphor duotone icons):
  - Chat (ChatCircle) — `/dashboard/chat`
  - Dashboard (ChartRadar) — `/dashboard`
  - Profile (UserCircle) — `/dashboard/profile`
  - Sessions (ClockCounterClockwise) — `/dashboard/sessions`
  - Settings (GearSix) — `/dashboard/settings`
- **Collapse toggle:** CaretLeft/CaretRight
- **Bottom:** Clerk `<UserButton />` with avatar + display name

### Collapsed state (~64px)

Icon-only sidebar, tooltips on hover via title or Radix Tooltip.

### Visual treatment

- Sidebar bg: `oklch(0.16 0.01 260)` (card color, slightly lighter than page)
- Active nav: primary color highlight + subtle glow
- Hover: Card Spotlight effect (radial gradient follows cursor)
- Transition: Motion `layout` animation for smooth expand/collapse
- Border Beam on active nav item

### Auth guard

Dashboard layout wraps content in Clerk auth check:

- Unauthenticated -> redirect to `/sign-in`
- Authenticated but no `onboarding_completed_at` -> redirect to `/onboarding`
- Authenticated + onboarded -> render dashboard

### Dashboard pages (placeholder empty states)

Each page renders a shadcn `Empty` component with Starry-themed messaging:

| Page                  | Empty State Message                                                                                                       |
| --------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `/dashboard/chat`     | "Starry is ready for your first conversation. Start with the Big Picture session to introduce yourself and your startup." |
| `/dashboard`          | "Your readiness scores will appear here after your first session with Starry."                                            |
| `/dashboard/profile`  | "Complete your first session to see your founder profile take shape."                                                     |
| `/dashboard/sessions` | "No sessions yet. Start a conversation with Starry to begin."                                                             |
| `/dashboard/settings` | Mentor mode selector (Coach/Supportive/Investor Lens) + notification preferences                                          |

### Backend endpoint

- `GET /api/founders/me` — returns current founder + startup profile + onboarding status (used by dashboard layout to check onboarding, by profile page, etc.)

### Frontend additions

- `apps/web/src/app/(dashboard)/layout.tsx` — replace bare div with full sidebar shell + auth guard
- `apps/web/src/components/sidebar.tsx` — collapsible sidebar
- `apps/web/src/components/nav-item.tsx` — nav link with active state + spotlight hover
- Update all dashboard page stubs with proper empty states

### Shared components (`packages/ui/`)

- `Sidebar` — collapsible sidebar with Motion animations
- `NavItem` — nav link with active indicator and Card Spotlight hover

