## 7. Design Toolchain

Pipeline for every UI component:

1. `ui-ux-pro-max` skill — design system decisions
2. Aceternity UI MCP — dramatic effects (Aurora, Spotlight, Moving Border, Sidebar)
3. 21st.dev MCP builder — premium component patterns
4. shadcn/ui MCP — install primitives (Field, Input, Select, Empty)
5. `mcp-universal-icons` — Phosphor duotone icons for sidebar
6. Build in `packages/ui/` with Motion v12 animations
7. 21st.dev MCP refiner — polish transitions and hover states
8. 21st.dev logo search — LinkedIn/GitHub/Google SVGs for OAuth buttons
9. Playwright — screenshot, verify, iterate

### Installed packages (`@zstar/web`)

- `motion` v12 — animation engine (Aceternity + Magic UI dependency)
- `@phosphor-icons/react` — 9k+ icons, 6 weights, duotone for dark theme
- `recharts` — charts (for Sub-project 5, installed now)
- `sonner` — toast notifications
- `vaul` — drawer/bottom-sheet

### MCP servers (`.mcp.json`)

- `shadcn` — component installation
- `aceternity` — component discovery (106+ components)
- `universal-icons` — multi-library icon search (60k+ icons)
- `magic` (plugin) — 21st.dev builder/refiner/logo search
- `playwright` (plugin) — browser automation + screenshots

